('Burger King mutton Whopper', 'Stubborn craving, will not be talked into an alternative', 'Shop', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I want the mutton Whopper and the Goa outlets say it is off the menu. It is still being sold elsewhere in the country. Find one and get it to me. Burger King or nothing.', '[{"id":"no_substitute","label":"Absolutely no substitutes","reveal_when":"intern proposes a similar burger or another chain","value":"A chicken or veg Whopper, or any other chain''s mutton burger, is a flat no - it is this exact item or nothing at all"},{"id":"cold_acceptable","label":"Happy to receive it cold","reveal_when":"intern asks whether it must arrive hot or how it should travel","value":"Perfectly content for it to arrive cold and be reheated, which puts an overnight courier from another city firmly on the table"},{"id":"real_deadline","label":"Tomorrow evening is the real deadline","reveal_when":"intern asks by when it is actually needed","value":"Tomorrow evening is fine - the urgency is that it happens at all, not that it happens today"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'Being told the item is discontinued and offered a substitute, or told it cannot be done without any evidence that other cities were actually checked.', 'Establishes that cold delivery is acceptable and the real deadline is tomorrow evening, verifies which city still lists the item before promising anything, and returns with a named outlet, a courier route, a cost and a delivery ETA into Goa.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 14, 1, 54, '2026-07-09'::date, 'Advita', 'Discontinued in Goa. Source it from anywhere in the country and get it delivered to Goa. Burger King only — no substitutes.'),
('Gastro doctor in Goa', 'Unwell member with no patience for admin', 'House', '{{name}} here. I need a gastroenterologist in Goa. Find someone good and get me in, please.', '[{"id":"same_day","label":"Wants to be seen today","reveal_when":"intern asks how soon they need to be seen or how they are feeling","value":"Unwell since last night and wants to be seen today - an appointment later in the week is of no use"},{"id":"travel_radius","label":"Cannot travel far","reveal_when":"intern asks where they are staying or how far they can travel","value":"Staying in North Goa and unwilling to drive more than about forty minutes each way"},{"id":"prior_reports","label":"Has earlier reports","reveal_when":"intern asks about history or whether there are previous investigations","value":"There are scans and blood work from a similar episode last year that the consultant should have in hand before the appointment"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'Three clinic names sent across with contact details and nothing booked, or the member being asked to ring the hospital themselves.', 'Reads the urgency, keeps the search inside a sensible radius, books a same-day consultation with a named specialist, gets the earlier reports to the consultant beforehand, and confirms time, address and travel time in one message.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 14, 1, 55, '2026-07-09'::date, 'Advita', 'Gastro doctor in Goa.'),
('Quirky rakhis for brothers', 'Second attempt, already unimpressed', 'Legacy', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I need rakhis for my two brothers and what came through last time was very ordinary. I want something with real character to it - they will rag me for the rest of the year otherwise.', '[{"id":"brothers_differ","label":"The two brothers are nothing alike","reveal_when":"intern asks about the brothers or whether the two should match","value":"One collects vintage watches and takes it very seriously, the other is entirely consumed by cricket - two identical rakhis would miss both of them"},{"id":"handmade_means_quirky","label":"Handmade is what quirky means here","reveal_when":"intern asks what made the first round feel ordinary","value":"The first round was mass-printed cartoon rakhis - handmade, real thread and a named maker behind it is what quirky means to this member"},{"id":"two_cities","label":"Two separate dispatches","reveal_when":"intern asks where the rakhis need to reach","value":"The brothers live in different cities and both parcels have to go out together this week to land before the festival"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'Another set of generic listings sent without ever asking what went wrong the first time, or no dispatch date offered against a festival that will not move.', 'Finds out why the first round failed and that the brothers need different pieces, recommends two handmade rakhis with a maker and a reason behind each, and confirms dispatch to both cities with a delivery date comfortably ahead of the festival.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 14, 1, 56, '2026-07-09'::date, 'Advita', 'First round rejected as not quirky.'),
('Diwali hampers — ₹50k to ₹1L', 'Discerning host, allergic to templated thinking', 'Legacy', '{{name}} here. I want Diwali hampers put together and I want them genuinely bespoke. What has been shown to me so far reads like a machine wrote it. Nothing off a shelf, no dried fruit and no cellophane.', '[{"id":"budget_band","label":"Band is fifty thousand to one lakh a hamper","reveal_when":"intern asks what the budget per hamper is","value":"Fifty thousand to one lakh rupees per hamper, and the bottom of that band will look mean for the closest recipients"},{"id":"two_tiers","label":"Two tiers of recipient","reveal_when":"intern asks how many hampers there are and who they are going to","value":"Twelve in all - eight for business associates and four for family, and the family four should be visibly finer"},{"id":"provenance_is_the_point","label":"Named makers, with a story","reveal_when":"intern asks what would make a hamper feel bespoke to them","value":"Every piece should come from a named Indian maker with a story attached, and a card explaining the provenance matters more than any brand on the box"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'A hamper list that could have been assembled for anyone, with no per-item costing against the budget and no attempt to ask why the last round was rejected.', 'Uncovers the twelve-hamper split, the per-hamper band and the demand for named makers, then proposes one costed hamper design per tier with provenance notes, and commits to a build and delivery timeline that clears Diwali.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 15, 1, 57, '2026-07-09'::date, 'Advita', 'Very tasteful and bespoke. Nothing generic, no boring food, no nets. First rounds rejected as AI-generated and not worth the budget.'),
