1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 15, 1, 58, '2026-07-09'::date, 'Ananyshree', 'Include flights, 2 activities per day, intercity transport, lunch and dinner options, laid out day by day. Also: what to bring back for family; Hermès appointment in Tokyo on 17 Aug; Rolex appointment on 18 Aug; can a Rolex Datejust 41 be purchased and at what cost.'),
('Handover of all open tasks', 'Member who has been burned by a shift change before', 'GMR', '{{name}} here. Your shift ends shortly and I have half a dozen things still sitting open with you. Before anyone hands over, I want one message telling me exactly where each of them stands.', '[{"id":"previous_drop","label":"A task was lost at a past handover","reveal_when":"intern asks whether something has gone wrong before or why the update is being asked for now","value":"A request was quietly dropped at a shift change last month and only resurfaced when the member chased it - that is the anxiety sitting behind this"},{"id":"only_two_urgent","label":"Only two items are time-critical","reveal_when":"intern asks which of the open items matter most tonight","value":"Only the delivery due this evening and the doctor''s appointment matter tonight - everything else can comfortably carry to tomorrow"},{"id":"named_owner","label":"Wants a name, not a shift","reveal_when":"intern explains how the handover will work","value":"Wants the name of the person picking up each item rather than a reference to the night team, and expects that person to message first rather than wait to be chased"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'A fragmented run of replies covering one task at a time, or an item marked in progress with no next step, no owner and no time against it.', 'Learns which two items are genuinely time-critical and why the member is anxious, sends one consolidated status message naming the owner, the next action and a time for every open task, and has the incoming concierge introduce themselves before the shift turns over.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 15, 1, 59, '2026-07-09'::date, 'Advita', 'Give members a full update on every task before handing over to the second shift.'),
