('Where to go in August — India, close to Goa', 'Open brief, wants the decision made for him', 'Global', '{{name}} here. We are thinking of getting away in August, somewhere in India and not too far from Goa. Where should we go.', '[{"id":"party","label":"Who is travelling","reveal_when":"intern asks who is going","value":"Him, his wife and another couple, so a four bedroom villa or two suites rather than standard resort rooms"},{"id":"monsoon_intent","label":"He actually wants the rain","reveal_when":"intern raises the weather or asks what he wants out of the trip","value":"He knows August is monsoon and that is the point, he wants green, quiet and rain, not beaches and crowds"},{"id":"transfer_limit","label":"Transfer tolerance","reveal_when":"intern asks how far he is willing to travel","value":"Nothing beyond a four hour drive or one short flight, he refuses a long transfer at the other end"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'He switches off if he is handed five destinations and asked to pick, or if a recommendation ignores the monsoon and tries to sell him a beach.', 'Draw out the party, the appetite for monsoon and the four hour limit, then recommend one destination and one specific property with nightly rate in INR, drive or flight time and an honest picture of August there, holding a single alternative in reserve.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 20, 1, 80, '2026-07-13'::date, 'Savio', 'Where to go in August — India, close to Goa.'),
