('Birthday gift delivery to Los Gatos, USA', 'Generous gifter, cares about the reaction rather than the price', 'Legacy', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I need a birthday gift delivered in northern California by {{date}}. Budget is not the issue, but it has to land well above what she is expecting.', '[{"id":"recipient","label":"Who it is for","reveal_when":"intern asks who the gift is for and what she is like","value":"It is for his sister in law turning forty, she works in tech and already buys herself anything she wants, so novelty matters more than value"},{"id":"local_sourcing","label":"Nothing may ship from India","reveal_when":"intern raises shipping, customs or lead time","value":"Nothing can ship from India because customs would miss the date, it has to be bought and delivered locally in the United States"},{"id":"note_timing","label":"How it should arrive","reveal_when":"intern asks how he wants it presented or delivered","value":"He wants a handwritten note in his own words included and the delivery timed for the morning, not the evening"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'He loses faith at a shortlist of luxury standards offered with no point of view, or at a delivery date promised before anyone has confirmed the item is already inside the United States.', 'Establish the recipient, the local sourcing constraint and the morning delivery with a handwritten note, recommend one gift with a clear reason it will land well, confirm United States stock and a guaranteed date, and own the tracking through to the doorstep.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 21, 1, 84, '2026-07-13'::date, 'Anishqa', 'Delivery date 20 July to California, USA. Budget open, but the gift should be well above expectations.'),
('Thailand visa process', 'Straightforward planner, wants a definitive answer not a link', 'Global', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I am planning a trip to Thailand and I have no idea what the visa position is these days. Can you walk me through the process, what it costs and how long it takes.', '[{"id":"passport_held","label":"Passport travelled on","reveal_when":"intern asks which passport the member travels on","value":"He travels on an Indian passport, which changes the exemption and e-visa rules entirely"},{"id":"travel_window","label":"Departure window","reveal_when":"intern asks when the trip actually is","value":"He flies in six weeks, so the slower e-visa route is still comfortably viable and there is no need for the premium express service"},{"id":"extra_traveller","label":"Minor travelling too","reveal_when":"intern asks who is travelling","value":"Three of them are going, including his nephew who is fourteen, and a minor needs additional consent paperwork"}]'::jsonb, 'medium', 'Being sent a government website link with no summary, no cost in INR, no processing time and no ETA on when a filled application will come back.', 'Surface the passport held, the travel window and the third traveller who is a minor, then return one consolidated message covering the correct visa route, the document list, the cost in INR and the processing time, with a committed ETA for the completed application.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 22, 1, 85, '2026-07-14'::date, 'Savio', 'Thailand visa process.'),
