('₹1 lakh hamper for a newly-wed — Mumbai', 'Precise gifter, wants sign-off before any spend', 'Shop', '{{name}} here. I need a hamper put together for a newly-wed couple in Mumbai, about 1 lakh. Send me the item list before you buy anything. It has to be with me by 4pm, the party is at 8.', '[{"id":"category_brief","label":"The categories are fixed","reveal_when":"intern asks what should go in it or whether there is a direction","value":"Scented candles, two shawls, his-and-hers crystal bracelets, a quirky money clip or cardholder and a passport holder; the labels can flex, the categories cannot"},{"id":"drop_point","label":"Where it actually goes","reveal_when":"intern asks where and to whom it should be delivered","value":"It goes as one wrapped hamper to a residence in Mumbai rather than the party venue, and household staff will receive it"},{"id":"substitution_rule","label":"Substitutions allowed only if flagged","reveal_when":"intern asks how to handle anything out of stock","value":"A like-for-like swap within 5 per cent of the price point is fine provided it is flagged on the list before purchase"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'Anything purchased before the item list is approved, or the afternoon handover confirmed without checking Mumbai stock and courier timings.', 'Draw the category brief out of the member, verify availability against the handover time, send one consolidated costed item list in INR for sign-off with every substitution flagged, then confirm wrapping, delivery point and receipt.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 26, 1, 101, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Savio', 'Share the item list first. Direction given: Jo Malone candles, 2 shawls from Paul Smith or Emporio Armani, his-and-hers Swarovski bracelets, a quirky Paul Smith money clip or cardholder, and a passport holder from Hugo Boss or Salvatore Ferragamo. Everything needed by 4:00 PM — the party is at 8:00 PM.'),
('Exotic destinations close to India', 'Well-travelled sceptic, allergic to the obvious', 'Global', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I want somewhere exotic and reasonably close to India for a short break {{date}}. Please do not say Sri Lanka, Indonesia or the Philippines — I have done all of those.', '[{"id":"trip_length","label":"Nights available and flight tolerance","reveal_when":"intern asks how long they have or when they can travel","value":"They have 5 nights and cannot take more, and they will not sit on a flight longer than about six hours"},{"id":"visa_rule","label":"Visa tolerance","reveal_when":"intern asks about visas or passports","value":"Only visa-on-arrival or e-visa destinations will do, because a consulate appointment kills the idea entirely"},{"id":"travel_party","label":"Travelling as a couple","reveal_when":"intern asks who is travelling","value":"It is a trip with their partner, so quiet beach and good food matter far more than diving or trekking"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'A list of eight destinations with no recommendation attached, or a suggestion that needs a consular visa after the constraint is known.', 'Establish the nights available, the e-visa rule and that it is a couples trip, then recommend one destination with flight time, visa route and an indicative cost in INR in the first message, holding a second only as the named alternative.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 26, 1, 102, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Savio', 'Excluding the obvious — Sri Lanka, Indonesia, Philippines.'),
('Post-wedding gift hamper — up to ₹10 lakh', 'Considered patron, judges the curation not the spend', 'Legacy', '{{name}} here. I need a post-wedding gift hamper for Mumbai, up to 10 lakh, before the month is out. Not just bags please — show me more thought than that, and put it all in one document.', '[{"id":"handover_day","label":"Handover day","reveal_when":"intern asks the exact date it has to be in hand","value":"It is handed over at a family lunch on the Saturday at the end of the month, so it must be wrapped and in Mumbai the day before"},{"id":"gifting_history","label":"What has already been given","reveal_when":"intern asks what the couple already have or what has been gifted before","value":"Handbags and luggage have been given twice already, so they would far rather art, fine tableware, a commissioned piece or an experience"},{"id":"doc_format","label":"How it must be presented","reveal_when":"intern asks how they want the options presented","value":"One cleanly named PDF with images, prices in INR and lead times against each piece, not a string of links across the chat"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'Options sent as scattered links, bags proposed after the gifting history is known, or a total presented with no lead times against the month-end date.', 'Surface the handover day, the gifting history and the document format, then deliver one cleanly named PDF with a recommended composition, prices in INR, lead times and a reason for each piece, with the balance of the budget accounted for and a hold placed on the long-lead items.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 26, 1, 103, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Ananyshree', 'Needed in Mumbai by month end. More options than just bags, compiled into one PDF.'),
('NYC tonight — restaurant and match-day bar', 'Same-night host, wants verified answers not maybes', 'Global', '{{name}} here, in New York. Seven of us tonight, and we like the sort of places Semma and Ambassadors do. Get us a table, then somewhere afterwards that is genuinely showing the match and can seat us.', '[{"id":"seating_time","label":"Seating time","reveal_when":"intern asks what time they want to sit","value":"They need to be seated by 7.30pm because two of the party fly out at dawn"},{"id":"dietary","label":"Covers with dietary needs","reveal_when":"intern asks about dietary requirements across the party","value":"Two of the group are vegetarian and one does not drink, so a fixed tasting menu with no alternative is a problem"},{"id":"anchor","label":"The match is the fixed point","reveal_when":"intern asks whether dinner or the match matters more","value":"The match is the anchor of the evening and dinner can move earlier or later around the kick-off"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'A shortlist of restaurants sent without checking tonight''s availability, or a bar named without confirming it is actually screening the match.', 'Confirm the seating time, the vegetarian covers and that the match is the anchor, ring both venues to verify the table for the full party and the screening, then reply in one message with dinner booked, a bar table held, kick-off time and the travel time between the two.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 26, 1, 104, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Ananyshree', 'Party of 7, tastes run to Semma and Ambassadors. Check availability at top restaurants for tonight, then a match-day bar — confirm which ones are actually screening the match and whether tables are available today.'),
('Rakhi gifting in Dubai', 'Family gifter, expects you to already know the recipient', 'Dubai', 'Hi, {{name}} here. Rakhi gift for my brother in Dubai. He cooks a lot, mostly Indian, he is travelling far more these days, he is buying a place there and has just taken delivery of a new SUV. Something he will actually use.', '[{"id":"dubai_deadline","label":"Must land before the festival","reveal_when":"intern asks when it has to be in Dubai","value":"It must be in his hands 2 days before the festival, and shipping from India will not make it, so it has to be sourced inside the UAE"},{"id":"budget_shape","label":"Budget and shape of the gift","reveal_when":"intern asks about budget","value":"Around 4,000 dirhams, and one considered piece is far preferred to a basket of small things"},{"id":"duplicate_risk","label":"Already gifted last year","reveal_when":"intern asks what he was given previously or already owns","value":"He was given a knife set last year, so anything cutlery-shaped is dead on arrival"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'A generic hamper proposed when his cooking, travel and new home are already on file, or a delivery date promised without checking what can be sourced locally.', 'Use what the backend already holds about him rather than asking it back, surface the UAE sourcing deadline, the dirham budget and the knife-set duplication, then recommend one gift with a costed second option and confirm the Dubai delivery slot and who will receive it.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 27, 1, 105, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Ananyshree', 'Recipient loves cooking including Indian food, travels internationally more often now, buying a new home in Dubai and may move this year, and recently bought a Mercedes GLE 450.'),
('Something mind-blowing this weekend', 'Open brief, wants a curator not a search engine', 'Global', '{{name}} here. I want something genuinely mind-blowing this weekend, anywhere in the country. Do not send me a list — tell me what you would book and why.', '[{"id":"party_and_start","label":"Party size and earliest start","reveal_when":"intern asks who is going and when they can start","value":"Four of them are going and two fly in on Saturday morning, so nothing can begin before midday that day"},{"id":"vip_and_weather","label":"VIP tier and rain policy","reveal_when":"intern asks about ticket tiers or what happens if the weather turns","value":"Only the VIP tier is of interest, and they want it in writing whether the event is refunded or rescheduled if it rains"},{"id":"no_repeat","label":"Not another concert","reveal_when":"intern asks what they have already done recently","value":"They have done two music weekends this year already and want something that is not a concert"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'Five ideas offered with no recommendation, or a shortlist sent without the VIP price and the wet-weather policy attached.', 'Establish the party size, the earliest start and that another concert is out, then recommend one experience with the VIP cost in INR, the operator''s rain policy quoted rather than assumed, travel and stay outlined, and a hold placed pending confirmation.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 27, 1, 106, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Advita', 'Anywhere in the country — the member just wants to be wowed. For the shortlisted option: VIP ticket cost and whether it is cancelled if it rains.'),
('What is open and what is carried forward', 'Exacting principal, auditing the desk', 'GMR', '{{name}} here. Before anything else this morning — what of mine is still open, and what has carried over from yesterday? I would rather not be the one doing the chasing.', '[{"id":"known_gap","label":"A slip they already know about","reveal_when":"intern asks whether anything in particular is on their mind","value":"They already know one delivery slipped yesterday and are quietly testing whether it appears in the list without being mentioned"},{"id":"format","label":"How the list must arrive","reveal_when":"intern asks how they would like it presented","value":"One message, every item carrying an owner and a next revert time, not a thread of separate updates"},{"id":"escalation_rule","label":"When to escalate without asking","reveal_when":"intern asks what should happen to anything overdue","value":"Anything running more than 2 days late should go to the desk lead without checking with them first"}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'An incomplete list, an item the member already knows about left out, or a status line given with no owner and no time attached.', 'Return one consolidated list inside the promised window covering both open and carried-forward items, each with an owner and a next revert time, the slipped delivery named unprompted and already escalated, and everything logged so the picture is visible without being asked for again.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 27, 1, 107, '2026-07-16'::date, 'Advita', 'Full list of tasks in progress, including anything carried over from the previous day.'),
('Worli, Bombay — recommendations', 'Bombay regular, allergic to generic lists', 'Global', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I am in Worli this week and I want proper recommendations, not the same three names everyone forwards. Somewhere I would not have found on my own please.', '[{"id":"occasion","label":"What the evening actually is","reveal_when":"intern asks what the recommendation is for or who is joining","value":"It is a quiet dinner with an old business partner on Thursday, not a night out, so the room has to allow conversation."},{"id":"already_done","label":"Places already exhausted","reveal_when":"intern asks where the member has already been in the area","value":"The obvious hotel restaurants in Worli have all been done twice this year and anything from that list is wasted."},{"id":"logistics","label":"Cost and distance expected upfront","reveal_when":"intern asks what he needs alongside the name","value":"He expects cost, distance from his office and the menu in the same message, and a table held rather than a suggestion."}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'Member goes cold if handed five well-known names with no reasoning, or if a recommendation lands without cost, distance and a time by which the booking will be confirmed.', 'Draw out the occasion and the venues already exhausted, then send one considered recommendation with cost, distance, menu and a table held, with a clear revert time attached.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 28, 1, 108, '2026-07-17'::date, 'Advita', 'Nothing generic.'),
