('Perfume recommendations', 'Precise about specification, checks whether it is honoured', 'Shop', 'Hey {{name}} here. I need perfume recommendations, citrus and fresh, something that actually survives the Goa humidity. Eau de parfum only, no toilette.', '[{"id":"wearer","label":"Who wears it and when","reveal_when":"intern asks who will be wearing it and where","value":"It is for the member himself in the daytime at the office, so nothing heavy or evening-leaning."},{"id":"owned","label":"Already owns the obvious houses","reveal_when":"intern asks what he already wears","value":"He already owns the 2 obvious Mediterranean citrus houses and wants something less immediately recognisable."},{"id":"spend","label":"Will pay more for uncommon","reveal_when":"intern asks about bottle size or budget","value":"He wants a full 100ml bottle and would rather pay more for something uncommon than settle for a safe choice."}]'::jsonb, 'advanced', 'Member is unimpressed if sent an eau de toilette after specifying eau de parfum, or if the shortlist reads like a search result with nothing on how it holds in humidity.', 'Honour the eau de parfum specification, surface the daytime office wear and the houses already owned, then recommend one or two uncommon citrus fragrances with notes, expected longevity in humidity, price and where it can be bought today.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 29, 1, 112, '2026-07-17'::date, 'Advita', 'Citrus and fresh scents that work in Goa. EDP only.'),
