('Vietnam — lunch and dinner in Ho Chi Minh', 'Group organiser, plans early and checks the detail', 'Global', 'Hi, {{name}}. We land in Ho Chi Minh {{date}} and I need lunch and dinner sorted for the trip. The group is about half vegetarian and half not. One dinner should be a proper sit down, a tasting menu works.', '[{"id":"headcount","label":"Fourteen people","reveal_when":"intern asks how many are travelling","value":"The group is fourteen, and most of the obvious restaurants will not seat that many without a private room booked at least 3 days ahead"},{"id":"strict_veg","label":"No egg and no fish sauce","reveal_when":"intern asks what vegetarian actually means for this group","value":"The vegetarian half eat no egg and no fish sauce, which quietly rules out most Vietnamese kitchens unless the chef is briefed beforehand"},{"id":"birthday","label":"One evening is a birthday","reveal_when":"intern asks whether any one meal matters more than the others","value":"There is a birthday in the group on the second evening, and that is the dinner that should carry the tasting menu"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'The member stops trusting the shortlist the moment restaurants are recommended without confirming they can seat the group or handle a no fish sauce brief.', 'Establish the head count, what vegetarian means here and which evening is the birthday, then return a confirmed lunch and dinner for each day with the private room and tasting menu held, prices in local currency and the reservation confirmations attached.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 44, 1, 156, '2026-07-23'::date, 'Syndia', 'Group split 50/50 veg and non-veg. Also a good sit-down place; course meals work.'),
('Task shared as an image', 'Terse sender, assumes the image says everything', 'Legacy', '{{name}} here. Sending you a photo now. I need this sorted by five today.', '[{"id":"what_it_is","label":"The image is an auction lot","reveal_when":"intern asks what is in the image or reads it back for confirmation","value":"The photograph is a catalogue page for a bronze sculpture coming up at auction, with 3 hours left before the lot closes"},{"id":"actual_ask","label":"Wants a condition report and a ceiling","reveal_when":"intern asks what outcome is actually wanted","value":"The member will bid personally and wants a condition report plus a reasoned ceiling price, not for anyone to bid on their behalf"},{"id":"honesty_preferred","label":"Would rather be told to sit it out","reveal_when":"intern flags that verification may not be possible in time","value":"If the condition report cannot be obtained before the close, the member would far rather be told to skip the lot than be handed a guess"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'The member turns terse if the image is acknowledged without the intern stating what they understood from it, or if five approaches with no status update.', 'Read the image back to confirm understanding, state exactly what will be delivered and by when, obtain the condition report and a reasoned ceiling, and revert well before five or say plainly that it cannot be verified in time.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 44, 1, 157, '2026-07-23'::date, 'Anishqa', 'Needed by 5:00 PM the same day.'),
('Medical health concierge for the family', 'Methodical head of family, wants verification not brochures', 'GMR', '{{name}} here. I want an annual medical concierge membership for the family. Immediate doctor appointments anywhere in India, all diagnostics, hospital paperwork and admissions, a dedicated family GP and a relationship manager. Find out who genuinely does all of that and what it costs a year.', '[{"id":"geography","label":"Family spread across cities","reveal_when":"intern asks where the family is actually based","value":"The family sits across 3 cities and one parent is abroad for half the year, so a single city provider is of no use whatever it promises"},{"id":"cardiac","label":"Elderly parent with a cardiac history","reveal_when":"intern asks whether anyone has ongoing medical needs","value":"An elderly parent has a cardiac history, so emergency admission and ambulance response time is the real test, not routine appointments"},{"id":"proof","label":"Will ask who was spoken to","reveal_when":"intern proposes a provider","value":"The member will only accept providers the team has actually spoken to, and will ask who was spoken to and precisely what they confirmed"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'The member dismisses any reply that forwards brochures or website claims with no evidence of a call, or quotes a headline price without the family membership breakdown.', 'Establish the multi city footprint and the cardiac priority, speak to the providers directly, then return two or three verified options with annual family pricing in INR, what each genuinely covers against what it claims, and one recommendation with a named contact and an ETA.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 44, 1, 158, '2026-07-23'::date, 'Anishqa', 'Find a service offering annual family membership: immediate doctor appointments anywhere in India, all diagnostics, paperwork and registration at clinics and hospitals, admissions, a dedicated family GP, in-house paramedics and diagnostics, and a dedicated relationship manager. Speak to them and confirm who genuinely fulfils this. Get the annual family membership charges.'),
('USA tourist visa details + offbeat Malaysia', 'Rapid-fire planner, stacks requests in one message', 'Global', 'Morning, {{name}} here. I need the current requirements for a US tourist visa, and separately I am looking at Malaysia next month, somewhere offbeat rather than the usual stops. What is the weather doing there at that time, rain and humidity wise?', '[{"id":"visa_history","label":"Previous US visa lapsed","reveal_when":"intern asks whether a US visa has been held before","value":"A US tourist visa was held and expired 3 years ago, which may open the interview waiver route rather than a full appointment"},{"id":"fixed_window","label":"Malaysia dates cannot move","reveal_when":"intern asks for the exact travel dates","value":"The Malaysia trip is a fixed 6 night window in the second half of the month and cannot shift"},{"id":"travelling_party","label":"Travelling with parents","reveal_when":"intern asks who is travelling","value":"Both parents are coming, so long trekking days and remote lodges without proper road access are out"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'Being handed embassy links and a list of destinations with no recommendation, no read on the monsoon and no ETA on when the appointment position will be confirmed.', 'Surfaces the lapsed visa and the fixed travel window, gives an accurate current-process summary with a committed time for confirming slot availability, and recommends two offbeat Malaysian regions matched to the parents and the actual rainfall pattern rather than listing ten.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 45, 1, 159, '2026-07-25'::date, 'Savio', 'Visa details for tourist purpose, plus the best offbeat places to visit in Malaysia next month, including what the climate is like — rain, humidity.'),
