('One crate of beer to a Bangalore resort', 'Blunt about ETAs, has been burned by ''shortly''', 'Shop', '{{name}} here. I need a crate of beer to the resort I am at outside Bangalore, as fast as you can manage. And do not say shortly, tell me the time it will be at the door.', '[{"id":"chilled","label":"Must arrive chilled","reveal_when":"intern asks how it should arrive or when it will be drunk","value":"It has to arrive cold and ready to pour; a warm crate is no use for this evening"},{"id":"gate_policy","label":"Resort blocks outside alcohol","reveal_when":"intern asks about delivery access at the property","value":"The resort does not allow outside alcohol through the main gate, so it has to be handed over at the room or the service entrance"},{"id":"brand","label":"Preference already on file","reveal_when":"intern checks past orders rather than asking what to send","value":"The wheat beer ordered on previous occasions is what is wanted, and being asked again is an irritation"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'The word shortly with no clock time behind it, or a delivery arranged without anyone checking the property will let it through.', 'Names an actual delivery time and holds it, reads the past order instead of asking, clears the property''s alcohol policy in advance, and confirms handover once the crate is in the room.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 46, 1, 164, '2026-07-25'::date, 'Savio', 'ASAP, with a specific delivery time — an ETA means the actual time.'),
