('Khandala resort & spa — research', 'Sceptical of brochures, wants proof', 'House', '{{name}} here. I am looking at a resort in Khandala for a weekend with friends coming up from Mumbai. Rooms, spa, pool, whatever there is to do in the evenings. And send pictures, not brochure copy.', '[{"id":"one_suite","label":"Party of five in one suite","reveal_when":"intern asks how many are staying and how they want to be housed","value":"5 friends want to stay in one large suite rather than scattered across separate rooms"},{"id":"weekend","label":"Fixed long weekend","reveal_when":"intern asks which weekend","value":"It is the Saturday of a long weekend, so availability is tight and needs holding immediately"},{"id":"spa_open","label":"Spa must be operational","reveal_when":"intern asks what would make or break the stay","value":"The spa being open and properly staffed is the entire point; a closed spa kills the booking"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'Marketing photographs passed off as current, or a stack of unlabelled links instead of one organised reply covering rooms, spa, pool and the game zone.', 'Confirms the party size and the weekend, verifies with the property that a suite for five, the spa and the games are genuinely available and in working order, and sends one structured reply with current images and an option held.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 47, 1, 166, '2026-07-25'::date, 'Ananyshree', 'Weekend getaway with Mumbai friends. Types of stays, amenities, things to do, pool, spa, games. Then: are any rooms or suites large enough for 4–5 people, images if so; confirm the spa and share images; images of the pool; images of the property exterior and view; details and condition of the board games and game zone.'),
