('Vietnam — best time to visit and climate', 'Planner who wants a verdict, not a table', 'Global', '{{name}} here. When is the right time to do Vietnam properly, and what is the weather actually like then? Also have a look at what is on at Kala Ghoda {{date}}.', '[{"id":"both_regions","label":"North and south in one trip","reveal_when":"intern asks which parts of the country","value":"The member wants the north and the south in the same trip, which is exactly why the timing is difficult"},{"id":"trip_length","label":"Nine days maximum","reveal_when":"intern asks how long the trip can be","value":"Only 9 days are available including flights, so an itinerary built on a fortnight is useless"},{"id":"guests","label":"Weekend outing is for visiting guests","reveal_when":"intern asks who the weekend plan is for","value":"Visiting guests are being taken out, so a gallery walk with lunch booked nearby is what is actually needed"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'A month-by-month climate table with no recommendation, or a weekend suggestion sent without checking what is genuinely open and showing.', 'Recommends one specific window that works for both regions inside nine days and states the real weather picture rather than an average, then closes the weekend request with verified opening times and a lunch table held.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 49, 1, 172, '2026-07-27'::date, 'Savio', 'Plus check Kala Ghoda.'),
('Sporting events and major concerts this year', 'Calendar-builder, hospitality access only', 'Dubai', 'Hi, {{name}} here. I am building the back half of my year around the Gulf season, the race weekend in particular. Give me the sport and the concerts worth going to, and tell me what I should be holding now.', '[{"id":"anchor_event","label":"Race weekend is the anchor","reveal_when":"intern asks which event the calendar is built around","value":"The Abu Dhabi race weekend is the fixed anchor and everything else is arranged around those dates"},{"id":"access_level","label":"Hospitality only","reveal_when":"intern asks what level of access is wanted","value":"Only paddock or suite level access is of interest; general admission tickets would go unused"},{"id":"party","label":"Two teenagers travelling","reveal_when":"intern asks who is going","value":"4 are travelling including 2 teenagers, so age limits at concert venues and lounges have to be checked"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'An undated list of everything happening globally, or events described as available without anyone checking that hospitality inventory is still open.', 'Anchors the calendar on the race weekend, verifies which hospitality packages and concert dates are genuinely still available, and returns a short holdable shortlist with dates, access level, age limits and a deadline for confirming.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 49, 1, 173, '2026-07-27'::date, 'Savio', 'Full list of both.'),
('Ralph Lauren shirt — call and check', 'Wants a phone call made, not a link sent', 'Shop', '{{name}} here. The shirt I sent you a picture of, call the store and find out whether they have it in a medium and when it would reach me. I do not want a screenshot of the website.', '[{"id":"deadline","label":"Needed for a dinner","reveal_when":"intern asks when it is needed by","value":"It is for a dinner on Friday, so anything arriving after Thursday evening is no use"},{"id":"fit","label":"Slim cut only","reveal_when":"intern asks about the fit or cut","value":"The member wears the slim cut; the classic fit in the same size would go straight back"},{"id":"alt_colour","label":"Would accept navy","reveal_when":"intern asks whether an alternative would be acceptable","value":"If the medium has gone, the member would take the same shirt in navy rather than wait for a restock"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'An online stock indicator quoted as fact, or a delivery date given without anyone having actually spoken to the store.', 'Genuinely calls the store, confirms the slim cut in medium and a real delivery date against the Friday dinner, and if it is unavailable offers the agreed alternative colour rather than coming back empty-handed.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 50, 1, 174, '2026-07-27'::date, 'Savio', 'Check whether the shirt in the image is available in size M, and confirm the delivery date.'),
('More unique flower options', 'Rejected the first attempt, expects a point of view', 'Shop', '{{name}} here. What you sent is what any florist would send. I want something with more thought behind it, and I need it {{date}}. Tasteful, not theatrical.', '[{"id":"why_rejected","label":"Presentation was the problem","reveal_when":"intern asks what specifically did not work about the first set","value":"The blooms were fine; it was the cellophane and ribbon presentation that made the whole thing look ordinary"},{"id":"occasion","label":"First year in a new home","reveal_when":"intern asks what the occasion is","value":"It marks the recipient''s first year in a new home, so something that lasts beyond a week would land far better"},{"id":"budget_up","label":"Will pay more for distinctive","reveal_when":"intern asks whether the budget can move","value":"The member will go to double the original figure for an arrangement that is genuinely distinctive"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'A second catalogue dump, or being asked what he would like instead when the entire point is that the concierge is expected to have a view.', 'Diagnoses that presentation rather than the flowers was the problem, uses the occasion to justify a longer-lasting or sculptural arrangement, and returns one confident recommendation with images, price and a delivery time.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 50, 1, 175, '2026-07-27'::date, 'Advita', 'The first set was rejected.'),
('More flair in member communication', 'Warm and conversational, wants a person not a process', 'GMR', 'Hi, {{name}} here. Just crawled out of a punishing week and I have people over {{date}}. Nothing formal, I just want it to feel nice. Honestly I am not sure what I am asking for yet, where do we start?', '[{"id":"quiet_celebration","label":"A quiet celebration","reveal_when":"intern asks warmly what is behind the evening rather than for a brief","value":"It is a quiet celebration of a promotion the member is slightly embarrassed to mention, and would love acknowledged without any fuss"},{"id":"guests","label":"Six guests, one flying in","reveal_when":"intern asks who is coming","value":"6 guests including a close friend flying in, so the evening should be built around that friend''s tastes"},{"id":"not_hosting","label":"Does not want to host actively","reveal_when":"intern asks how much the member wants to be doing on the night","value":"The member does not want to cook or run the evening; a chef at home with the table fully set is what is actually wanted"}]'::jsonb, 'expert', 'A clipped run of questions fired one after another, or a reply that reads like a form being filled in rather than a conversation.', 'Opens warmly and draws the occasion out in conversation rather than interrogation, uncovers the quiet celebration, the guest count and the wish not to host, and proposes a chef-at-home evening with one personal touch and a clear next step, all in a human voice.', '{"comprehension":1,"brand_tone":1,"factual_accuracy":1.5,"proactivity":1,"escalation_judgment":1,"closure":1}'::jsonb, 50, 1, 176, '2026-07-27'::date, 'Advita', 'Talk to members with more warmth and engagement rather than working through a checklist.')
) AS v(
  title, archetype, vertical, opening_message, hidden_constraints, difficulty,
  escalation_trigger, ideal_outcome, rubric_weights,
  group_number, day_number, task_number, task_date, raised_by, brief
)
WHERE NOT EXISTS (
  SELECT 1 FROM public.scenario_seeds s WHERE s.task_number = v.task_number
);
